# ---------------------------------------------------------------- The Crossroads

# Orcs and Trolls arrive from Durotar first: their own steps below (only Orc / only Troll /
# only Orc,Troll), merged from the former orc/troll lead-in guides in 0.3.1, run before the
# Crossroads step labelled `crossroads`, where every Horde race starts. Both come in from Far
# Watch Post: they hand Crossroads Conscription (842) to Sergra and take Meats to Orgrimmar here.
# Warriors finish Thun'grim Firegaze / Forged Steel (1502, 1503) by the Razormane camp; Shamans
# finish Call of Fire (1524-1527): the Fire Tar from the Razormane, Telf Joolam's brazier across
# the river and Kranal Fiss. The former lead-in ids are in guides/retired.json.

step The Crossroads
  only Orc,Troll
  zone The Barrens
  tip You arrive from Far Watch Post. Zargh and Sergra stand by the inn, Helbrim and Gazrog by the north gate; Devrak, Thork and Darsok on the tower platform.
  accept 6365                         -- Zargh
  turnin 842                          -- Sergra Darkthorn
  accept 844
  accept 869                          -- Gazrog
  accept 1492                         -- Apothecary Helbrim
  accept 848
  turnin 6365                         -- Devrak, on the tower
  accept 6384
  getfp "Crossroads"
  accept 5041                         -- Thork
  accept 871
  accept 867                          -- Darsok Swiftdagger: the harpies come later, in the Dry Hills

